<Description>
<![CDATA[FT105 Control Logic not associated with Device Iteration Logic]]>
</Description>
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[When the FT105 (Device 9) Output is on - write the HMI setpoint to the flow meter to start dosing system]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Device[9].Output)MOV(FT105B.SP_HMI,FT105B.SP_W);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[When FT105 (Device 9) output bit is OFF - write the 0 to the flow meter controller - shutting if OFF (ie not running)]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(Device[9].Output)MOV(0,FT105B.SP_W);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Take the Device error time from HMI in seconds and mulitply by 1000 to get ms and put in  device error timer preset]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[CPT(FT105B.HighPressureTimer.PRE,FT105B.HighPressureTime*1000) ,CPT(FT105B.HighPressureLimit_Int,FT105B.HighPressureLimit_HMI*100) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[When PT105 output bit is over 40 psi - write the 0 to the flow meter controller - shutting if OFF (ie not running)]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[GRT(PT105_PV_RAW,FT105B.HighPressureLimit_Int)TON(FT105B.HighPressureTimer,?,?);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
