</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="9" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Write to bit 1 of the SINT Anybus_ETH_SER:O.Data[10].0 to trigger the clear reset (needed before Alarm reset)
Write to bit 1 of the SINT Anybus_ETH_SER:O.Data[11].0 to trigger the Alarrm Reset]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(FT105.AlarmReset)[OTE(Anybus_ETH_SER:O.Data[10].0) ,OTE(Anybus_ETH_SER:O.Data[11].0) ];]]>
